{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 22,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Aijeleth Shahar, A Psalm of David. My God, my God, why hast thou forsaken me? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "why art thou so far",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from helping me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the words of my roaring?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O my God, I cry in the day-time, but thou hearest not; and in the night season, and am not silent.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " holy, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "O thou",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that inhabitest the praises of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our fathers trusted in thee: they trusted, and thou didst deliver them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They cried to thee, and were delivered: they trusted in thee, and were not confounded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a worm, and no man; a reproach of men, and despised by the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All they that see me deride me: they shoot out the lip, they shake the head, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He trusted on the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he would deliver him: let him deliver him, seeing he delighted in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that brought me forth into life: thou didst make me hope ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "when I was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon my mother's breasts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I was cast upon thee from my birth: thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my God from the time I was born.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not far from me; for trouble ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " near; for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none to help.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many bulls have compassed me: strong ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "bulls",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Bashan have beset me round.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They gaped upon me ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their mouths, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a ravening and a roaring lion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am poured out like water, and all my bones are out of joint: my heart is like wax; it is melted in the midst of my bowels.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My strength is dried up like a potsherd; and my tongue cleaveth to my jaws; and thou hast brought me into the dust of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For dogs have compassed me: the assembly of the wicked have inclosed me: they pierced my hands and my feet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I may number all my bones: they look ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " stare upon me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They part my garments among them, and cast lots upon my vesture.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But be not thou far from me, O LORD: O my strength, haste thee to help me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver my soul from the sword; my darling from the power of the dog.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Save me from the lion's mouth: for thou hast heard me from the horns of the unicorns.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will declare thy name to my brethren: in the midst of the congregation will I praise thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye that fear the LORD, praise him; all ye the seed of Jacob, glorify him; and fear him, all ye the seed of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath not despised nor abhorred the affliction of the afflicted; neither hath he hid his face from him; but when he cried to him, he heard.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My praise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of thee in the great congregation: I will pay my vows before them that fear him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The meek shall eat and be satisfied: they shall praise the LORD that seek him: your heart shall live for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the ends of the world shall remember and turn to the LORD: and all the kindreds of the nations shall worship before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the kingdom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD'S: and he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the governor among the nations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fat upon earth shall eat and worship: all they that go down to the dust shall bow before him: and none can keep alive his own soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A seed shall serve him; it shall be accounted to the LORD for a generation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.22.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.22.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall come, and shall declare his righteousness to a people that shall be born, that he hath done ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
